{"uid":"bc1d7e037138b7dd","name":"TC-253 @stripe: a customer's Stripe order reaches the owner with the same receipt, items, total and contact, and the owner works it to Picked Up","fullName":"owner/06b-orders-journey.spec.ts:103:7","historyId":"65708ccc4b4fac0e2a662fdebca8d604:3098a0ca20f1e4b8d78d8c2f8ff8302f","time":{"start":1791526694424,"stop":1791526721591,"duration":27167},"description":"THE through-line. Guest places a real pickup order on Template Wind (`page`); the owner (`ownerPage`) opens it by id — same receipt #, 'Customer paid' equals the checkout total, the item is listed, Customer Info shows the name/phone the customer typed — then finds it in the grid by the customer's surname (exactly one row) and marks it Confirmed → Preparing → Ready → Picked Up. Never searches by the confirmation page's 'Order #' — that is the DAILY order number, not the permanent receipt.","descriptionHtml":"<p>THE through-line. Guest places a real pickup order on Template Wind (<code>page</code>); the owner (<code>ownerPage</code>) opens it by id — same receipt #, 'Customer paid' equals the checkout total, the item is listed, Customer Info shows the name/phone the customer typed — then finds it in the grid by the customer's surname (exactly one row) and marks it Confirmed → Preparing → Ready → Picked Up. Never searches by the confirmation page's 'Order #' — that is the DAILY order number, not the permanent receipt.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"testStage":{"description":"THE through-line. Guest places a real pickup order on Template Wind (`page`); the owner (`ownerPage`) opens it by id — same receipt #, 'Customer paid' equals the checkout total, the item is listed, Customer Info shows the name/phone the customer typed — then finds it in the grid by the customer's surname (exactly one row) and marks it Confirmed → Preparing → Ready → Picked Up. Never sea